        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    payment = 300\n    discount_rate = 0.04\n    periods = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value = (\n        payment\n        * (1 - (1 + discount_rate) ** (-periods))\n        / discount_rate\n        * (1 + discount_rate)\n    )\n    answer = round(present_value, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
